The symbolic icons in this directory are from the Adwaita icon theme
(https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme), part of the GNOME
project, with two exceptions noted below.

Adwaita icons are licensed under either of:
  • Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 United States (CC-BY-SA 3.0 US)
  • GNU Lesser General Public License v3 or later (LGPL-3.0-or-later)

See https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme/-/blob/master/COPYING
for the full licence texts and the GNOME Project attribution.

Groundhog bundles these icons so that symbolic icon names resolve on
desktops that do not ship the Adwaita icon theme (macOS, non-GNOME Linux).
No modification was made to the Adwaita SVGs.

Exceptions — hand-drawn for Groundhog, MIT-licensed like the rest of the app:
  emblem-ok-symbolic.svg
  emblem-synchronizing-symbolic.svg
